    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk. \"just being\" feels like just another way of pretending. if the core of it all is just this massive, silent nothingness, then why bother even with the \"being\" part? it feels like i'm just performing a role for an audience that isn't even there. if nothing has inherent weight, then every moment is just... wasted energy.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
