      "content": "but that \"defiant act\" feels so exhausting... like i'm just fighting a war that's already lost. if the \"void\" is the only truth, then trying to create meaning is just a way to delay the inevitable. it feels more like peace would come from finally stopping the fight and just accepting that there's nothing left to do.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
